# GeneratedRules.lua is byte-compared against the generator's output by
# scripts/gen-lua-rules.test.ts, and the generator emits LF. Without this,
# core.autocrlf=true checkouts rewrite it to CRLF and the drift gate fails
# for a reason unrelated to the drift it exists to catch. The WoW client
# loads LF and CRLF alike, so pinning the whole addon to LF is free.
*.lua text eol=lf
